  "details": "Within the last month or so I started getting \"Wrong Video Card\" errors when I try to launch VRChat. It happens every few days and I have no clue why. VRChat is the only game this happens for, VR or otherwise, and no other program is running abnormally.\nI don't have more than one video card and my motherboard does not have any integrated graphics. I haven't found a common cause yet but the only working solution is to completely restart the computer. \nThis is infuriating since I typically have to spend the next half hour saving, rebooting, and reopening all of my work that I had before being forced to reboot, which at this point is several times a week.",
